    "directions": [
      "Cook the fish in a little bit of salt and water for 10 mins and let it cool.",
      "Drain excessive water and mash with a fork.",
      "Mix all the ingredients with the fish. Divide into 15 portions, flatten them with your hands & keep aside. Roll all tikkies in refined flour till well-coated.",
      "Heat oil in a flat nonstick pan and shallow fry the tikkis until golden brown in color from both the sides.",
      "Serve hot with green chutney and onion salad."
